cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Analysis code for: Decomposing the shift from hepatitis B to non-alcoholic fatty liver disease burden, GBD 2023, 1990-2023, with scenarios to 2035"
abstract: >-
  Python code that reproduces every quantitative result in the manuscript: a
  four-component decomposition of the change in a two-cause burden share
  (hepatitis B versus NAFLD), approximate uncertainty intervals derived from GBD
  count intervals, and anchored scenarios to 2035. A script-to-result
  traceability table is included, and all reported estimates are provided as CSV
  files in results/. Raw GBD exports are not redistributed; download parameters
  and the SHA-256 hashes of the inputs are given in the README.
